    "/apis/v1/fantasyfootballcalculator-com/fantasy-sports-rankings/adp": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Where players go in drafts for a scoring format and league size, this season or any season back to 2007.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\n按用量计费；默认请求预估费用：$0.0005 USD（不是固定价格）。 最终费用以账户适用价格及实际结算为准。\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
        "operationId": "fantasyfootballcalculator-com.fantasy-sports-rankings.adp",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {
                  "format": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Draft format. Default ppr.\n\nProvider reference: allowed values [\"standard\", \"ppr\", \"half-ppr\", \"2qb\", \"dynasty\", \"rookie\"]; default \"ppr\".",
                    "default": "ppr",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "oneOf": [
                        "standard",
                        "ppr",
                        "half-ppr",
                        "2qb",
                        "dynasty",
                        "rookie"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "limit": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Return only the top N. Omit for the whole list (the site sends it in full).\n\nProvider reference: minimum 1; maximum 500.",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "min": 1,
                      "max": 500
                    }
                  },
                  "position": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "Default ALL.\n\nProvider reference: allowed values [\"ALL\", \"QB\", \"RB\", \"WR\", \"TE\", \"K\", \"DST\"]; default \"ALL\".",
                    "default": "ALL",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "oneOf": [
                        "ALL",
                        "QB",
                        "RB",
                        "WR",
                        "TE",
                        "K",
                        "DST"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "teams": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "League size; changes only adp_formatted (round.pick). Default 12.\n\nProvider reference: allowed values [\"8\", \"10\", \"12\", \"14\"]; default 12.",
                    "default": 12,
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "oneOf": [
                        "8",
                        "10",
                        "12",
                        "14"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "year": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Draft season. Omit for the current season. History starts in 2007 for standard, 2010 for ppr, 2014 for 2qb and rookie, 2015 for dynasty and 2018 for half-ppr; a season without data is not_found.\n\nProvider reference: minimum 2007; maximum 2100.",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "min": 2007,
                      "max": 2100
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              "examples": {
                "provider": {
                  "summary": "Official provider example; checked against AIsa request constraints",
                  "value": {
                    "format": "ppr",
                    "limit": 5,
                    "position": "QB",
                    "year": 2025
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Average draft position from Fantasy Football Calculator mock drafts via GET https://fantasyfootballcalculator.com/api/v1/adp/{format}?teams&year&position: overall ADP, round.pick, earliest and latest pick, standard deviation and times drafted per player, with the number of drafts and the date window they cover.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\nThe provider identifies `players` as the primary payload key.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `adp` | number | Average overall pick. |\n| `adp_formatted` | string | Average pick as round.pick for the league size, for example 1.03. |\n| `bye_week` | number | Null for free agents. |\n| `high` | number | Earliest overall pick. |\n| `low` | number | Latest overall pick. |\n| `name` | string |  |\n| `player_id` | number | Fantasy Football Calculator player id. |\n| `position` | string |  |\n| `stdev` | number |  |\n| `team` | string | Team abbreviation, or FA. |\n| `times_drafted` | number |  |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
