    "/apis/v1/fantasyfootballcalculator-com/fantasy-sports-rankings/rankings": {
      "post": {
        "description": "This week's start/sit order and projected points for a position in standard, PPR, half-PPR or 2-QB scoring, or long-term dynasty and rookie rankings.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\n按用量计费；默认请求预估费用：$0.0005 USD（不是固定价格）。 最终费用以账户适用价格及实际结算为准。\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
        "operationId": "fantasyfootballcalculator-com.fantasy-sports-rankings.rankings",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "additionalProperties": true,
                "properties": {
                  "format": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "standard (non-PPR), ppr, half-ppr or 2qb weekly rankings with projections; dynasty or rookie (dynasty rookie) rankings. 2qb projections use standard scoring. Default ppr.\n\nProvider reference: allowed values [\"standard\", \"ppr\", \"half-ppr\", \"2qb\", \"dynasty\", \"rookie\"]; default \"ppr\".",
                    "default": "ppr",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "oneOf": [
                        "standard",
                        "ppr",
                        "half-ppr",
                        "2qb",
                        "dynasty",
                        "rookie"
                      ]
                    }
                  },
                  "limit": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "description": "Return only the top N. Omit for everything the page lists: the whole table for dynasty, rookie and positions with under 50 players, the site's top 50 for other season-long pages (reported as partial coverage).\n\nProvider reference: minimum 1; maximum 500.",
                    "x-alexandria-option-metadata": {
                      "in": "body",
                      "min": 1,
                      "max": 500
                    }
                  },
                  "position": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "description": "ALL (overall), QB, RB, WR, TE, K, DST (team defense) or FLX (RB/WR/TE). Rookie rankings have no K or DST. Season-long pages stop at the site's top 50, so ALL and FLX cover fewer players than the per-position pages together; call QB, RB, WR, TE, K and DST for depth.\n\nProvider reference: allowed values [\"ALL\", \"QB\", \"RB\", \"WR\", \"TE\", \"K\", \"DST\", \"FLX\"]."
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "position"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "provider": {
                  "summary": "Official provider example; checked against AIsa request constraints",
                  "value": {
                    "format": "half-ppr",
                    "limit": 10,
                    "position": "QB"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Fantasy Football Calculator rankings for one scoring format and position, parsed from the server-rendered page https://fantasyfootballcalculator.com/rankings/{format}/{position}: rank, team, bye week and, for the season-long formats, this week's projected fantasy points; dynasty and rookie rankings carry age instead. Season-long rankings are always the site's current week, echoed as week, and the site publishes only its top 50 per season-long page (the per-position pages reach deeper than ALL); dynasty and rookie pages are complete.\n\nThe response contains the tool result directly.\n\nThe provider identifies `players` as the primary payload key.\n\n| Documented field | Provider type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `age` | number | Dynasty and rookie rankings only; null elsewhere and for team defenses. |\n| `bye_week` | number | Null for free agents. |\n| `name` | string |  |\n| `player_url` | string |  |\n| `position` | string |  |\n| `projected_points` | number | Projected fantasy points this week in the requested scoring (the site's Proj. FP, from RotoWire projections). Null for dynasty and rookie rankings. |\n| `rank` | number |  |\n| `team` | string | Team abbreviation, or FA. |\n\n\nThese are the provider's documented fields. Field requiredness, nullability and nested object structures are specified only where the descriptions explicitly say so.",
            "content": {
